usage: run_final_benchmark.py [-h] [--mode {validate-reports,run-live}]

PolyFlow Report Validation and Artifact Verification Tool. Validates test
suites and exports from raw run receipts. NOTE: To execute live paired model
trials, use scripts/run_benchmark.py.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {validate-reports,run-live}
                        Execution mode: 'validate-reports' verifies test
                        suites and exports; 'run-live' dispatches to
                        scripts/run_benchmark.py for live agent trials.
